ck requires exactly 3\");\n  it.todo(\"charges 175 G base premium for 7 runes\");\n  it.todo(\"does not combine 2 runes and 1 moonstone into a block -- 75 G base premium\");\n  it.todo(\"prices 3 runes and 3 moonstones as two separate blocks -- 120 G base premium\");\n  it.todo(\"applies a cursed surcharge only to the affected sword -- 210 G before policy modifiers and fee\");\n  it.todo(\"applies the loyalty discount at exactly 2 years\");\n  it.todo(\"applies both curse and high-enchantment surcharges at enchantment 5\");\n  it.todo(\"does not apply high-enchantment surcharge at enchantment 4\");\n  it.todo(\"rounds a 197.5 G premium up to 198 G\");\n  it.todo(\"pays 400 G for regular sword damage of 500 G after one deductible\");\n  it.todo(\"pays 100 G for rune damage of 200 G after one deductible\");\n  it.todo(\"pays 600 G when sword and amulet damages each have their own deductible\");\n  it.todo(\"pays 400 G for dragon sword enchantment 8 damage of 1000 G because the 50 percent clause wins\");\n  it.todo(\"pays 400 G for dragon sword enchantment 9 damage of 1000 G\");\n  it.todo(\"pays 700 G for dragon sword enchantment 5 damage of 800 G\");\n  it.todo(\"pays 400 G for steel sword enchantment 9 damage of 1000 G\");\n  it.todo(\"rounds a raw payout of 350.5 G down to 350 G\");\n  it.todo(\"gives two insured swords a 4000 G cap and treats two damage entries separately\");\n  it.todo(\"rejects more damage entries of a type than the policy covers\");\n  it.todo(\"uses a 3200 G cap for a sword and amulet policy\");\n  it.todo(\"uses an unmodified 2000 G cap for a cursed sword\");\n  it.todo(\"uses a 3500 G cap for a sword and 3-rune block\");\n  it.todo(\"exhausts a sword policy cap across two 1500 G claims -- payouts 1400 then 600\");\n  it.todo(\"rejects an unknown quote item type without producing results\");\n  it.todo(\"rejects damage to a known item type absent from the policy\");\n  it.todo(\"rejects an unknown damage item type\");\n  it.todo(\"rejects a n